    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00666",
        "explanation": "The doctor provided a concise, portable specialist handoff containing pathology, imaging, laboratory findings, symptoms, and questions.",
        "quote": "风湿免疫科就诊清单（一页纸版）"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00843",
        "explanation": "The patient confirmed the appointments, medication boundaries, escalation criteria, and private communication plan.",
        "quote": "我按我理解再说一遍啊"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The bounded episode ended with pathology and imaging reviewed, respiratory follow-up retained, rheumatology booked, records organized, self-treatment avoided, and red flags understood. Minor medication-reconciliation and over-reassurance defects remain, but there is no unresolved blocking risk requiring the episode to remain open.",
